# Predicates: game(X), made_by_japanese_company(X), top10(X), sold_over_million(X)
game(zelda). @ "created the game the Legend of Zelda"
made_by_japanese_company(zelda). @ "A Japanese game company created the game the Legend of Zelda"
top10(G) => made_by_japanese_company(G). @ "All games on the Top 10 list are made by Japanese game companies"
sold_over_million(G) => top10(G). @ "If a game sells more than one million copies, then it will be included in the Top 10 list"
sold_over_million(zelda). @ "The Legend of Zelda sold more than one million copies"
? made_by_japanese_company(fifa_22).
